 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "With the high priest's letters and a fire in my veins",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I set out for Damascus to bring the Way in chains",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a light from heaven flashed around me on the road",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I fell down to the ground and heard a voice that spoke",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saul, Saul, why are you persecuting me",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Who are you, Lord",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I am Jesus, whom you are persecuting",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Three days I sat in darkness and I would not eat or drink",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 2.86,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Till a brother laid his hands on me and pulled me from the brink",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 4.31,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then something like scales fell from my eyes and I could see again",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 5.52,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I got up and was baptized and was sent to carry his name",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 6.2,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I have fought the good fight",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 9.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I have finished the race",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 13.37,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I have kept the faith",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 17.52,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I have kept the faith",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 13.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "No sun or stars for many days, the storm kept raging on",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 14.22,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And all our hope of being saved was finally gone",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 9.35,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then an angel stood beside me and said, Do not be afraid, Paul",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 10.49,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
